# Asset Licensing Terms

This repository contains third-party historical artworks, bundled typography fonts, and original project assets. The licensing terms for each asset category are defined below.

---

## 1. Historical Masterwork Artworks (`game/assets/images/`, `assets/2D/`)

The 23 sacred masterwork paintings featured throughout the book and application are in the **Public Domain (`PD-Art / CC0`)**. 

Because the original artists (Murillo, El Greco, Champaigne, Reni, Carpaccio, Van Orley, Ricci, Bloch, David, Rubens, Battistello, Van Dyck, Raphael, Copley, Maíno, Velázquez) died more than 100 years ago, copyright in these historic works has expired worldwide. In accordance with legal standards (such as *Bridgeman Art Library v. Corel Corp.*), faithful photographic reproductions of two-dimensional public domain artworks are likewise in the public domain worldwide.

